### Check Departments
GET http://localhost:4004/hr/Departments


### Check Employees
GET http://localhost:4004/hr/Employees


### Check Projects
GET http://localhost:4004/hr/Projects


### Check Skills
GET http://localhost:4004/hr/Skills


### Check Assignments
GET http://localhost:4004/hr/Assignments


### Check EmployeeSkills
GET http://localhost:4004/hr/EmployeeSkills

### Create Department
POST http://localhost:4004/hr/Departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deptName": "IT Department",
  "description": "Handles software and systems",
  "budget": 500000,
  "currency_code": "INR",
  "location": "Bhubaneswar"
}

### Create Employee
POST http://localhost:4004/hr/Employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Prajnashree",
  "lastName": "Pradhan",
  "email": "prajna@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "hireDate": "2026-06-04",
  "salary": 35000,
  "currency_code": "INR",
  "jobTitle": "SAP CAP Developer",
  "isActive": true,
  "country_code": "IN",
  "department_ID": "36ff2b19-f8d9-4087-89eb-d289e5ba7839"
}

### Create Project
POST http://localhost:4004/hr/Projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectName": "HR Management System",
  "description": "CAP based HR project",
  "startDate": "2026-06-04",
  "endDate": "2026-07-04",
  "budget": 200000,
  "currency_code": "INR",
  "status": "Active",
  "manager_ID":"01351ab7-3250-4ba7-8649-2a0205fb9648"
}

### Create Assignment
POST http://localhost:4004/hr/Assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Developer",
  "allocation": 80,
  "startDate": "2026-06-04",
  "endDate": "2026-07-04",
  "employee_ID": "ac74730b-715c-4336-992b-100a1179334d",
  "project_ID": "2d9ff4cb-7ff6-4e20-ae1e-ceaae20b00a6"
  
}
### Employee with Department and Assignments
GET http://localhost:4004/hr/Employees?$expand=department,assignments